  "reason": "The existing evidence shows config_020 (0.542 accuracy) is the current best with scgpt RNA, imagenet_vit_l image, avgpool, and weighted fusion. This experiment tests using transformer aggregation (more complex) with the same RNA and image encoders but concat fusion. While concat fusion is less effective than weighted, transformer aggregation might compensate, offering a balance between exploration (testing a more powerful architecture) and exploitation (using proven encoders). The expected cost is ~12 GPU hours, which is justified by the potential to improve accuracy while keeping RNA/image encoders optimal."
}

